        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    closing_prices = [150, 152, 155, 151, 154, 156, 157, 158, 160, 162, 161, 159]\n    lookback_period = 5\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    window = closing_prices[-lookback_period:]\n    rank = sorted(window).index(closing_prices[-1]) + 1\n    answer = (100 / (lookback_period - 1)) * (rank - 1)\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(answer, 2)\n```",
